    "reviews": "\u201cThe cats are cute, the assistance is a fun addition, and the fact that it has difficulty levels at all is great. There\u2019s accessibility here, and good physics. A good pick for any Watermelon game lover.\u201d<br>\ud83d\udc4d \u2013 Ladies Gamers<br>",
